{"title":"Career roadmap · Podcast Producer","role":"Podcast Producer","summary":"A Podcast Producer manages the development and production of audio programmes from concept to publication. The role can include research, episode planning, guest coordination, interviewing, scripting, recording, editing, sound design, publishing, audience analytics and content strategy.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Media & Communication / Digital Media / Podcasting"},"about":[{"label":"Alignment","text":"Strong direct alignment"}],"intro":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"A student can enter through production, research, audio-editing or content-assistant roles before becoming a full producer."}]}],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Typical route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["BA Media/Digital Media","Podcast/Media Internship","Production Assistant / Podcast Intern","Associate Podcast Producer","Podcast Producer","Senior Producer","Executive Producer","Head of Audio / Podcast Network Lead"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Master audio production, storytelling, interviewing, research, editing and digital publishing."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Build a specialised podcast portfolio and develop audience-growth, production-management and commercial skills."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Lead multiple shows, production teams, budgets, partnerships and original content development."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Progress toward Executive Producer, Head of Audio, Podcast Network Lead, Content Director or independent production-company founder."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Audio storytelling fundament